@startuml
title Payment processing communication
object "customer:Customer" as C
object "service:PaymentsServiceBL" as S
object "repository:PaymentRepositoryImpl" as R
object "payment:P-1" as P
C -> S : 1: processPayment(P-1)
S -> P : 1.1: require state Pending
S -> P : 1.2: set state Completed
S -> R : 1.3: save(P-1)
R --> S : 1.4: "P-1"
S --> C : 2: success(paymentId)
note bottom
Links match payment-object.puml, payment-state.puml and system-service-classes.puml.
payment-state.test.ts verifies the save and all valid/invalid transitions.
@enduml

